   "definition_quote": "At each round t = 1, 2, . . . of the game the environment picks a loss vector ℓ_t ∈ [0, 1]^K and the learner picks an action A_t to exploit and an action B_t to explore. ... Then the learner blindly suffers ℓ_{t,A_t} and observes ℓ_{t,B_t} without suffering its loss. In the oblivious adversarial setting, the environment chooses ℓ_t arbitrarily prior to the beginning of the game."
